Package: freeram
Version: 2.1.0
Section: system
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), coreutils, mawk | gawk
Maintainer: mrprohack <mrprohack@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Linux page-cache inspection and cleaning utility
 Inspect Linux memory cache usage and, when explicitly run as root, request
 the kernel to drop page caches. Includes dry-run, statistics, history,
 installer/uninstaller, man page, and regression tests.
